  "notes": [
    "Downloads and disk images remain outside the repository; no application binaries, ZIP archives or disk images are committed.",
    "The console is line-oriented. Printable input was delivered with Enter; function, cursor and Alt keys were not used for these game probes.",
    "Life2 reached its instruction pages and EDIT mode. Its RUN mode uses the PC speaker timer through OUT 40h, which the runner does not implement.",
    "ShuffleV is LZEXE-compressed and its Turbo Vision screen renders before the unsupported 66h opcode stops it.",
    "Champ Galagon and Nero 5 returned to the shell before 0.6 s with no console output; their failing VGA/display probe was not isolated further.",
    "TypeFast remained running but displayed a blank console; the game screen and prompts never became visible."
